miniflow
Copyright 2026 Vespera (linmoxi33)

This product is an independent, clean-room reimplementation of a small
subset of workflow-orchestration concepts popularised by Apache Airflow.
It was written from scratch for the purpose described in README.md and
contains no source code copied from Apache Airflow.

